          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ Do the diagonals of a rhombus intersect at any particular angle? Reason out and/or experiment to figure this out!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.141,
            0.847,
            0.18
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Deduction 10—What can we say about the angles formed by the diagonals of a rhombus at their point of intersection?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.192,
            0.492,
            0.232
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In the rhombus GAME, we have "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\Delta \\mathrm{GEO} \\cong \\Delta \\mathrm{MEO} (\\mathrm{why?})"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.236,
            0.492,
            0.312
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\angle GOE = \\angle DOE,"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " as they are corresponding parts of congruent triangles. As they add up to "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 8 0 ^ { \\circ } ,"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " they should be "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "9 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " each."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
